@* macOS: the user interface.
Dear ImGui runs unchanged on macOS, and so does most of the user interface: the panels,
their layout, the controls and the protocol of the probe are shared with the first part,
module by module. What remains is the code that touches vectors, textures, files or
the operating system. The header differs only in the types of a few members.

