@ With the Metal back end, ImGui's texture identifier is a pointer to an |MTL::Texture|.
(Its own code, written in Objective-C, reads the same pointer as an |id<MTLTexture>|; the
two are the same object, see \S\ref{macmain}.)

<<Private helpers of the application (macOS)>>=
